Package: a5R
Title: A5 Discrete Global Grid System
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R:
    person("Hugh", "Graham", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "hugh.a.graham@gmail.com")
Description: Bindings for the A5 Discrete Global Grid System (DGGS). A5
    partitions the Earth's surface into pentagonal cells across 31
    resolution levels using an equal-area projection onto a dodecahedron.
    Provides functions for indexing coordinates to cells, traversing the
    cell hierarchy, computing cell boundaries, and compacting/uncompacting
    cell sets. Powered by the 'a5' Rust crate via 'extendr'.
